<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 08:14:34 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>天线可替代树</title><link>https://some.pics/6af02f67d4f39</link><description>&lt;p&gt;既然天线一样好，为什么还要用树呢？&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A laughing kookaburra sits on a televisions antenna looking to the left. You can see the blue tints on its wings and its massive puffed up head. The sky is lovely and blue behind it with some light clouds." height="2765" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/tristy/6af02f67d4f39.jpg" width="2074"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://tristy.some.pics"&gt;@tristy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 08:14:34 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>买魔法用品要量力而行</title><link>https://some.pics/6aeff08930b09</link><description>&lt;p&gt;购买魔法用品时，预算很重要。如果一副漂亮的牌组超出了你能轻松承受的花费，你完全可以把它留在店里。认真对待巫术并不意味着要忽视你的日常需求。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Painted fantasy scene of a witch with hands in coat pockets admiring a boxed card deck in a charcoal shop window beneath rose-pink awnings. Enormous interlocking keys pave the market street, ivy climbs the doorway, and a gold emblem sits at bottom-right. Text: Your budget matters when you buy magical supplies. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6aeff08930b09.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 03:46:19 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>傍晚好云</title><link>https://some.pics/6aefeb4e1fc5c</link><description>&lt;p&gt;最近傍晚的云彩真不错。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A huge dark cloud bank settles in over an orange and blue sky as the sun sets. Below, the dark silhouette of a tree. A single, smaller cloud sits in between the two." height="2560" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/tristy/6aefeb4e1fc5c.jpg" width="1920"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://tristy.some.pics"&gt;@tristy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 03:24:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>塔马夸五岔路口市中心</title><link>https://some.pics/6aefdf4506b8d</link><description>&lt;p&gt;塔马夸市中心，位于宾夕法尼亚州309号公路与209号公路交汇的“五点”地带。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Brick corner building labeled Flat Iron, street with cars, traffic lights, and cloudy sky." height="3814" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/jmock/6aefdf4506b8d.jpg" width="5085"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://jmock.some.pics"&gt;@jmock&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 02:32:41 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>橡树</title><link>https://some.pics/6aefd743eb7da</link><description>&lt;p&gt;橡树&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Low-angle view of a large oak tree with thick branches and green leaves against a clear blue sky, with string lights hanging on the right." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/macmanx/6aefd743eb7da.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://macmanx.some.pics"&gt;@macmanx&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 01:58:36 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>雨后院中玫瑰</title><link>https://some.pics/6aefd4e1a9eae</link><description>&lt;p&gt;雨后我院子里的一朵玫瑰&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="a bright pink rose with water droplets" height="1426" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6aefd4e1a9eae.jpg" width="1426"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 01:48:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>芝加哥天际线奥黑尔视角</title><link>https://some.pics/6aefd47281a8d</link><description>&lt;p&gt;从奥黑尔机场附近看到的芝加哥天际线&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="a road with cars is in the foreground and it's a clear day so you can see the sears tower and a few other buildings very well despite the distance" height="1291" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6aefd47281a8d.jpg" width="1291"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 01:46:28 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>装饰艺术风格回忆</title><link>https://some.pics/6aefd3a0666c6</link><description>&lt;p&gt;我喜欢装饰艺术风格，我记得这大概是七月份的时候。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="the des plaines theater in des plaines illinois. the building is from the 1920s/1930s in the art deco style " height="1250" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6aefd3a0666c6.jpg" width="1250"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 01:42:59 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>红雀访院</title><link>https://some.pics/6aefd3147bee4</link><description>&lt;p&gt;几个月前，一位红衣主教朋友来访我的院子&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="a male cardinal is perched on a tree branch" height="1669" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6aefd3147bee4.jpg" width="1669"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 01:40:39 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>一年前发色与衬衫相配</title><link>https://some.pics/6aefd2a337ebc</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一年前，我的发色和衬衫颜色相配&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="a close up of a bedazzled misfits t-shirt and my bright purple hair" height="1440" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6aefd2a337ebc.jpg" width="1440"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 01:38:46 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>